The dataset used by this project (MoleculeNet "Lipophilicity", an AstraZeneca
logD7.4 deposition distributed via ChEMBL) is not covered by this licence and
is not redistributed here; it is downloaded from its public source at build
time and pinned by sha256.

ChEMBL data is released under the Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0
Unported licence. EMBL-EBI's terms of use (Data, section 3) state that EMBL-EBI
places no additional restrictions on use or redistribution beyond those of the
original data owners, and require attribution. DeepChem, which hosts the file,
licenses its own code under MIT.

Two things are deliberately not asserted, because they could not be verified
against a primary source: the exact ChEMBL deposition identifier, and the
licence of the data file itself as distinct from the licence of the code that
distributes it. The MoleculeNet datasets page returns 404 and neither host
declares a licence for the file. Anyone redistributing this data should
establish both for themselves rather than rely on this note.
